<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11588] The wrong result for Query</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11588</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I use modified C++ Query Example (see attached files) that verify the received result against expected one and print out message if they&apos;re different. &lt;br/&gt;
Just copy *.cpp file in &lt;tt&gt;platforms/cpp/examples/query-example/src&lt;/tt&gt; and build example project&lt;br/&gt;
1. Start two nodes &lt;tt&gt;bin\ignite.bat query-example-fix.xml -v&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
2. Run query-example.exe: &lt;/p&gt;
